<title>USA: William Morris names Rifkin president - report.</title>
<headline>William Morris names Rifkin president - report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Morris Agency named Arnold Rifkin president, replacing Jerry Katzman who would become vice chairman, Daily Variety said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Walter Zifkin, who was chief operating officer, would assume the title of chief executive officer and Norman Brokaw would remain chairman, the report said.</p>
<p>(New York newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
